Package: rmnchfunding
Title: Tools For Reproducible RMNCH Funding Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Meltem", "Odabaş", , "me@meltemodabas.net", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6123-0676"))
Description: Calculates bilateral and multilateral reproductive, maternal, newborn and child health (RMNCH) and family-planning funding from OECD Creditor Reporting System (CRS) data under three methodologies, with user-adjustable percentage tables. Provides muskoka1(), muskoka2() and revised_fp().
